        "name": "Set History Range",
        "func": "let range = msg.payload;\n\nconst allowed = [\n    \"30m\",\n    \"1h\",\n    \"3h\",\n    \"6h\",\n    \"24h\",\n    \"7d\"\n];\n\nif (!allowed.includes(range)) {\n    return null;\n}\n\nflow.set(\"history_range\", range);\n\nreturn msg;",
